OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmostly clear overnight tonight with
OL,7,Fsome patchy cloud across much of the
OL,8,Fregion. With light winds, isolated
OL,9,Fmist will develop once more. However,
OL,10,Fmost places will stay rather mild for
OL,11,Fthe time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAnother bright and mostly
OL,14,Fsunny day across the region with
OL,15,Ffurther patchy cloud in the northwest.
OL,16,FRather warm in the sunshine, with
OL,17,Ftemperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
