OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning much wetter in the north on
OL,7,FWednesday with some heavy rain but
OL,8,Fstaying mostly dry further south for
OL,9,Fthe next few days. Temperatures return
OL,10,Fto average.
